  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Air Hop</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 新增了一個簡單但令人滿足的全新移動附魔，讓你在半空中也能再次跳躍。🪽 讓玩家在探索、跑酷、戰鬥以及應對棘手著陸時擁有更多控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組的核心是這個新附魔，可應用於腿部護甲，並根據附魔等級提供額外的空中跳躍次數。每一次跳躍都反應靈敏，並有可選的雲霧粒子效果和俏皮的音效回饋。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">將單次跳躍轉變為一連串的空中爆發，修正失誤、跨越間隙，並擴展原版無法實現的移動方式。⚡</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪽 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">空中跳躍：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Air Hop</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔在空中跳躍，在探索、戰鬥或從失誤的跳躍中恢復時獲得額外的機動性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📈 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">等級跳躍：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更高的附魔等級允許在落地前進行更多次空中跳躍。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腿部護甲附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Air Hop</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔應用於護腿，使其成為自然的機動性升級。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌫️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跳躍回饋：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雲霧粒子效果和跳躍音效讓每次空中跳躍都清晰且反應靈敏。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">平衡配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可自訂關鍵平衡選項，包括耐久度消耗、摔落傷害行為、飢餓限制以及視覺或音效。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可以直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行配置（在 Fabric 上需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動配置，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 中，根據配置類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型都會存在於模組中，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/intektor\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Intektor</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/double-jump\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Double Jump</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組中對這個附魔的原始實現，對本專案啟發良多。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.zapsplat.com/\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Zapsplat</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 提供本模組使用的跳躍音效。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/open-together\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchantment-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantmentinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/held-item-tooltips\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
